    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Harrington are delighted to present this beautifully presented and substantially extended four-bedroom family home.\r\n\r\nThe property has been thoughtfully upgraded to create a stylish, spacious and highly practical home. A bright entrance hall with feature wall panelling leads to a generous front living room, separate family room and dining area. Sliding barn-style doors allow the dining space to be opened into the hall or closed off when required.\r\n\r\nThe standout feature is the impressive extended kitchen to the rear. This bright and contemporary space features extensive fitted cabinetry, marble-effect worktops, a large central island with breakfast-bar seating and integrated appliances. Recessed lighting and large sliding doors bring excellent natural light into the room and provide direct access to the rear garden. A separate utility room and guest WC complete the ground-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are four bedrooms, including a generous main bedroom with ensuite shower room. A family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from a low-maintenance front garden with off-street parking and gated pedestrian access to the side. The private rear garden has been attractively landscaped with artificial grass, large-format paving, raised planting beds and timber boundary fencing, creating an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining and family life.\r\n\r\nLambay View is a mature and highly regarded residential development close to the centre of Rush. The property enjoys a wonderful coastal setting within easy reach of local beaches, schools, shops, cafés, sporting facilities and everyday amenities. Rush & Lusk railway station, regular bus services and convenient access to the M1 provide connections to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport and the wider surrounding area.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, 26 Lambay View offers generous and versatile accommodation in a sought-after seaside location. This impressive home is certain to appeal to families and those seeking additional space in a well-established community.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nBright and welcoming entrance hall with timber-style flooring, feature wall panelling, recessed lighting and understairs storage.\r\n\r\nLiving Room – 3.22m x 4.93m\r\nGenerous front reception room with timber-style flooring, recessed lighting and feature fireplace.\r\n\r\nFamily Room – 2.57m x 3.47m\r\nVersatile additional reception room suitable as a family room, playroom or home office.\r\n\r\nDining Area – 2.71m x 3.47m\r\nWell-proportioned dining space with timber-style flooring and sliding barn-style doors.\r\n\r\nKitchen – 4.84m x 5.76m\r\nImpressive extended kitchen with an excellent range of fitted units, marble-effect worktops, large central island with breakfast-bar seating, integrated appliances, recessed lighting and sliding doors to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUtility Room – 3.22m x 1.21m\r\nSeparate utility area providing laundry facilities and additional storage.\r\n\r\nGuest WC\r\nConvenient ground-floor WC.\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom – 3.07m x 4.12m\r\nSpacious double bedroom with ensuite shower room.\r\n\r\nEnsuite – 2.30m x 1.00m\r\nFitted with shower, WC and wash-hand basin.\r\n\r\nBedroom Two – 3.23m x 3.47m\r\nGenerous double bedroom overlooking the rear.\r\n\r\nBedroom Three – 2.03m x 3.47m\r\nWell-proportioned bedroom overlooking the rear.\r\n\r\nBedroom Four – 2.20m x 2.65m\r\nSuitable as a single bedroom, nursery or home office.\r\n\r\nBathroom – 2.30m x 1.61m\r\nFully tiled family bathroom with bath and overhead shower, WC and wash-hand basin."
      },
